<LegalLayout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure (FTC Compliance)"
  description="FindPoise's editorial policy and disclosure regarding affiliate links and advertising relationships."
>
  <h2>Federal Trade Commission (FTC) Compliance</h2>
  <p>
    The Federal Trade Commission requires that we disclose any relationship we have between a product provider or retailer when we write about a product or service.
  </p>

  <h2>How FindPoise Is Funded</h2>
  <p>
    FindPoise is a reader-supported, independent editorial website. When you click on links on our site that take you to a merchant (such as FlexiSpot, Uplift Desk, Secretlab, Herman Miller, Autonomous, Amazon.com, or other retailers), we may receive an affiliate referral commission if you complete a purchase.
  </p>

  <h2>Our Editorial Integrity Guarantee</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Zero Paid Positive Reviews:</strong> We never accept monetary payment, free product bribes, or sponsored placements in exchange for a positive review or higher ranking in our comparison showdowns.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Equal Scrutiny:</strong> Products are tested and evaluated based on measurable technical specifications: frame stability, motor decibel readings, lifting speed, load capacity, warranty term, and real community feedback (from verified forums like Reddit).
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>No Additional Cost to You:</strong> Using our affiliate links never incurs extra cost. In fact, we frequently partner with manufacturers to provide exclusive coupon codes (e.g. <code>FINDPOISE15</code>) that save you money at checkout.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Amazon Associates Disclaimer</h2>
  <p>
    FindPoise is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com and affiliated sites.
  </p>

  <h2>Questions or Corrections?</h2>
  <p>
    If you have any questions regarding our affiliate relationships or notice an outdated product price, please reach out to our team at <code>contact@findpoise.com</code>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
